OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment 'failed to make the
OL,4,Acase' for #33bn Heathrow expansion,
OL,5,Areport finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government has "failed to make the
OL,8,Fcase" for Heathrow Airport's expansion,
OL,9,Fthe chair of the Transport Committee
OL,10,Fhas said, as a highly anticipated
OL,11,Freport on the #33bn project is
OL,12,Fpublished.
OL,14,FRuth Cadbury said the draft Heathrow
OL,15,FExpansion National Policy Statement did
OL,16,Fnot adequately address noise, air
OL,17,Fpollution and climate tests.
OL,19,F"Plans for a third runway should be
OL,20,Fgrounded for now and the government
OL,21,Fshould go back to the drawing board,"
OL,22,Fshe said.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
